<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
    xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events"
    xmlns:w2="http://www.inswave.com/websquare" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms">
    <head>
        <w2:type>COMPONENT</w2:type>
        <w2:buildDate/>
        <w2:MSA/>
        <xf:model>
            <w2:dataCollection baseNode="map">
                <w2:dataMap id="dma_date">
                    <w2:keyInfo>
                        <w2:key id="BASDT" name="기준일자"/>
                    </w2:keyInfo>
                </w2:dataMap>
            </w2:dataCollection>
            <w2:workflowCollection/>
        </xf:model>
        <w2:mfeSubmission/>
        <w2:layoutInfo/>
        <w2:publicInfo method=""/>
        <script lazy="false" type="text/javascript"><![CDATA[
scwin.onpageload = function() {

};
]]></script>
        <style type="text/css"><![CDATA[
.guide { display:block; margin:10px 10px 2px; color:#0a7; font-size:13px; }
.msg   { display:block; margin:0 10px 10px; color:#c00; font-size:12px; }
]]></style>
    </head>
    <body ev:onpageload="scwin.onpageload">

        <w2:textbox id="guide1" class="guide" style=""
            label='inputCalendar 유효성 속성 적용 - dateValidCheck="true" validOnInput="true" displayMessage="true" validCheck="true" validateRef="true" : 잘못된 날짜 입력 시 유효성 체크 및 메시지 표시'/>

        <w2:textbox id="guideTest" class="guide" style="color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:8px;background:#fafafa;" escape="false"
            label='[테스트 방법]&lt;br/&gt;1. inputCalendar 에 "2026-06-24" 붙여넣기 (정상 입력 확인)&lt;br/&gt;2. 입력값 전체 삭제&lt;br/&gt;3. "22222222" 입력 → 유효성 메시지 표시 확인&lt;br/&gt;4. 메시지 확인 후 다시 "2026-06-24" 붙여넣기&lt;br/&gt;→ [버그] "2026-06-" 까지만 입력되고 일(24)이 누락됨'/>

        <w2:inputCalendar id="cal1"
            ref="data:dma_date.BASDT"
            style="margin:10px;width:180px;height:23px;"
            calendarValueType="yearMonthDate"
            dateValidCheck="true"
            validOnInput="true"
            displayMessage="true"
            validCheck="true"
            validateRef="true"
            alt="기준일자 선택"
            title="기준일자 직접 입력"/>
    </body>
</html>
